{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53029","headline":"太原进铁镜赋附歌 · 乔琳","name":"太原进铁镜赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金之精兮衆宝所参，镜之明兮羣象所含。\n清至莹兮氛埃不杂，明至察兮丑类相慙。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一○五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔琳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}